{"updated":"2026-11-26T23:58:11.499Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: Georgian police clash with Turkiye’s Besiktas fans over Palestinian flag. Elsewhere, Israeli settlers damage Palestinian family’s homes in West Bank attack. And in Canada, Quebec’s religious symbols ban faces a Supreme Court test. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on Ukraine, at active conflict levels, though Iran, and US are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, felt the weight of it — the S&P 500 down 5.8 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial down 3.9 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite down 9.1 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 40 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 5.7 near Revilla Gigedo Islands region. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.1,0.16,0.2,0.23,0.28,0.33,0.36,0.4,0.44,0.49,0.52,0.56,0.59,0.61,0.66,0.79,0.88,1.03,1.31,1.43,1.47,1.5,1.52,1.57,1.59,1.61,1.64,1.68,1.73,1.8,1.86,1.9,1.95,2,2.04,2.08,2.11,2.17,2.23,2.26,2.3,2.36,2.4,2.45,2.5,2.53,2.59,2.66,2.73,2.84,2.94,3.11,3.13,3.18,3.2,3.26,3.31,3.38,3.47,3.55,3.61,3.68,3.71,3.76,3.81,3.85,3.9,3.92,3.96,4,4.03,4.05,4.08,4.12,4.17,4.25,4.31,4.39,4.47,4.54,4.66,4.7,4.76,4.78,4.83,4.95,5.1,5.27,5.78,5.84,5.93,5.97,6.01,6.07,6.12,6.15,6.19,6.26,6.3,6.36,6.43,6.5,6.57,6.62,6.66,6.73,6.8,6.88,6.95,7.01,7.06,7.09,7.13,7.16,7.2,7.26,7.31,7.38,7.44,7.5,7.58,7.61,7.65,7.69,7.71,7.77,7.81,7.89,7.95,8.07,8.13,8.19,8.3,8.36,8.43,8.47,8.63,8.72,8.84,9.01,9.13,9.17,9.22,9.24,9.3,9.34,9.42,9.47,9.54,9.59,9.66,9.73,9.79,9.87,9.91,9.95,10.03,10.09,10.17,10.35,10.46,10.58,11.02,11.13,11.19,11.25,11.3,11.34,11.41,11.45,11.51,11.59,11.64,11.68,11.8,11.88,11.96,12.03,12.09,12.13,12.18,12.24,12.28,12.35,12.4,12.47,12.53,12.57,12.61,12.65,12.71,12.77,12.86,12.92,12.99,13.04,13.1,13.14,13.19,13.26,13.32,13.38,13.42,13.48,13.55,13.61,13.68,1